{
  "irVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "slack-cellular",
  "title": "Slack 蜂窝架构：可用区即单元",
  "kind": "architecture",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "Slack Engineering, 'Slack's Migration to a Cellular Architecture' (2023-08-22)",
    "note": "组件与拓扑取自原文；三个 AZ、每 AZ 内服务只与同 AZ 通信（siloing）是原文明确的设计约束",
    "tags": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://slack.engineering/slacks-migration-to-a-cellular-architecture/"
    }
  },
  "containers": [
